- Dune3D: https://github.com/dune3d/dune3d · https://docs.dune3d.org/en/latest/why-another-3d-cad.html · FOSDEM 2026: https://fosdem.org/2026/schedule/event/UUVWPM-dune_3d_-_2_12_years_in_the_3rd_dimension/
